{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13723","headline":"酬漳州张九使君 · 顾况","name":"酬漳州张九使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人穷越徼，狂生起悲愁。\n山海万里别，草木十年秋。\n鞭马广陵桥，出祖张漳州。\n促膝堕簪珥，辟幌戛琳球。\n短题自兹简，华篇讵能酬。\n无阶承明庭，高步相追游。\n南方荣桂枝，淩冬舍温裘。\n猿唫郡斋中，龙静檀栾流。\n薜鹿莫徭洞，网鱼卢亭洲。\n心安处处安，处处思遐陬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}